        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pregnancy Sex Through the Trimesters Medically Reviewed by Jennifer Wu, M.D., F.A.C.O.G.",
        "text_sha256": "391e948e1e5b5fc8ea66c77534ebcb59a600dc944e8ad7c2447aa0be68294f09",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
